WEBVTT

00:14:28.153 --> 00:14:30.596
as much subject to scientific analysis

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.556
as any other phenomenon in biology,

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.710
or, for that matter, the rest of science.

00:14:34.734 --> 00:14:36.092
Thank you very much.

00:14:36.116 --> 00:14:41.609
(Applause)